# SYNTHETIC — hand-written from RFC 1939, not a recording.
# The phase-0 capture against a real server has not happened yet.
# The fixture password is the literal s3cret. It is not a credential.

S: +OK POP3 server ready
C: USER student
S: +OK
C: PASS s3cret
S: +OK 3 messages
C: UIDL
S: +OK
S: 1 0000000a4b2c1d3e
S: 2 0000000a4b2c1d3f
S: 3 abcd/ef+12
S: .
C: QUIT
S: +OK bye
DONE
